Package: SampleSurvival
Title: Sample Size Calculation for Survival Analysis Studies
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Victor J.", "Vera-Ponce", email = "victor_jvp@hotmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements an events-per-predictor-parameter planning heuristic
    for multivariable association studies, with logistical planning and observed
    event-count summaries. The denominator excludes the intercept and includes
    all predictor coefficients. A default EPV of 20 is an operational choice,
    not a guarantee of model stability. No regression model is fitted.
